@startuml
|Director|
start
:Receive funds;
:Select student and sponsor;
:Create sponsorship record;

|Secretary|
:Select sponsorship;
:Enter amount and date;
:Add reference number;
:Confirm contribution;

|System|
:Record in contribution table;
:Log to audit trail;

|Coordinator|
:Initiate payout to student;
:Select payment category;
:Enter amount in BDT;
:Note receipt references;
:Confirm payout;

|System|
:Deduct from available balance;

if (Total payout exceeds total in?) then (Yes)
  :Reject payout;
  :Show insufficient funds;
  else (No)
  :Record in payout table;
  :Log to audit trail;
  stop
endif

stop
@enduml
